    "selection": "The 5 of 8 EPI golden vectors whose SHA-256(input) reconciles end-to-end with the AlgoVoi canonicaliser. The 3 omitted (StepModel_source_type_excluded, Nested_deep_content, Empty_collections_in_step) are pending an authoritative-column / canonical_json reconcile on the EPI side; see microsoft/agent-governance-toolkit discussion 806."
